  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Harwich MA</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4841 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod-tech tag-harwich-ma tag-monomoy-regional-high-school tag-scholarship\" id=\"post-4841\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-of-harwich-artists-offers-scholarship-to-graduating-seniors/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild of Harwich Artists Offers Scholarship to Graduating Seniors</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-01-20T12:42:41-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 20, 2020, 12:42 pm\">January 20, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>HARWICH- The Guild of Harwich Artists is accepting applications for the 2020 Guild of Harwich Artists Inc. Scholarship. The $1,000 scholarship is open to any graduating senior who meets one <a href=\"/news/guild-of-harwich-artists-offers-scholarship-to-graduating-seniors/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3947 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3947\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"640\" height=\"392\" alt=\"A picture of a teepee in a frame.\" src=\"/media/archive/e2325b07094631c7cfe0ba8a3e2febc6f3657fa559d9a197eb0c5621d263b66f.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meet The Artist August 4</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-31T21:17:51-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, July 31, 2018, 9:17 pm\">July 31, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Would you like to talk art with a master artist? Join Paul Hammersten who will spend the day, Saturday, August 4 discussing such questions as: What is art? Can creating <a href=\"/news/meet-the-artist-august-4/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3941 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-passport-to-the-arts tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3941\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three women standing in front of a table with paints on it.\" src=\"/media/archive/bc8c17abbef9ade1c4bb8883a302263adaca3acf408992e7dd60fc16fd579e70.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Busy Saturday in Harwich Port</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-07-23T14:37:13-04:00\" title=\"Monday, July 23, 2018, 2:37 pm\">July 23, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted “Meet The Artist” with Marion Harcourt on Saturday, July 21. The Art Gallery also held the afternoon reception for the <a href=\"/news/busy-saturday-in-harwich-port/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3820 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-monthly-meetings category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-paint-the-town tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-wet-sale tag-wychmere-harbor\" id=\"post-3820\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Annual Paint The Town, Saturday June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-12T01:53:26-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, June 12, 2018, 1:53 am\">June 12, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Annual “Paint The Town” en plein air event will be held Saturday, June 16 from 9:00 am – noon. Watch for Guild of Harwich Artists in the following locations: Harwich <a href=\"/news/annual-paint-the-town-saturday-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3819 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-community-center tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-monthly-meetings tag-paint-the-town tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-the-warm-side-of-the-cape\" id=\"post-3819\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Sponsors Free Art Events June 16</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-11T13:59:12-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 11, 2018, 1:59 pm\">June 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dear Artists and Art Lovers: YOU’RE INVITED! The Guild of Harwich Artists invites you to a “Make and Take” event When? Saturday, June 16, 2018, 1:30p.m. to 4:00p.m. Where? Harwich <a href=\"/news/guild-sponsors-free-art-events-june-16/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3817 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-cape-cod tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-harwich-ma tag-harwich-port tag-meet-the-artist tag-paul-hammersten tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3817\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"395\" height=\"296\" alt=\"When the spirit tells my story of the cygnine.\" src=\"/media/archive/4eb263ed6631e879a24a2a32898c58ff4bf1160fd0a7b98325ca13fa3a6db570.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" rel=\"bookmark\">June 9 Meet The Artist</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-06-04T23:58:40-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 4, 2018, 11:58 pm\">June 4, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Master Artist Paul Hammersten will be at The Art Gallery of the Guild of Harwich Artists on Saturday, June 9 from 10 AM to 4 PM to share the story <a href=\"/news/june-09-meet-the-artist/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>4</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
